<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Hocheng Jan sales down 6.15 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Hocheng Jan sales down 6.15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hocheng Corp, Taiwan's largest sanitaryware maker, said on Wednesday its January sales fell 6.15 percent to T$460.72 million from T$490.928 million in January 1996.</p>
<p>January profit figure was not available.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
